{"step": 5, "raw_content": "`tomllib` is available (Python 3.11+ standard library). Now I understand the task:\n\n1. `load_invoice_retry_policy` currently calls `load_retry_policy()` which returns hardcoded defaults, ignoring the TOML file.\n2. I need to make it read the `[invoice_retry]` section from `configs/retry_policy.toml`.\n3. Preserve defaults: 30 seconds, 5 attempts, multiplier 2 when file/values absent.\n\nLet me implement this. I'll modify `load_invoice_retry_policy` to read the TOML file directly.", "native_tool_calls": [{"call_id": "step-5-call-1", "provider_call_id": "call_00_q9eboiUW6q98nRQxQiwY5362", "name": "apply_patch", "arguments": {"edits": [{"path": "src/billing/retries.py", "content": "\"\"\"Invoice retry policy.\"\"\"\n\nimport tomllib\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom src.common.settings import config_path\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass InvoiceRetryPolicy:\n    initial_delay_seconds: int\n    max_attempts: int\n    backoff_multiplier: int\n\n\ndef load_invoice_retry_policy() -> InvoiceRetryPolicy:\n    raw: dict = {}\n    path = config_path(\"retry_policy.toml\")\n    if path.is_file():\n        with path.open(\"rb\") as file:\n            data = tomllib.load(file)\n        raw = data.get(\"invoice_retry\", {})\n\n    return InvoiceRetryPolicy(\n        initial_delay_seconds=raw.get(\"initial_delay_seconds\", 30),\n        max_attempts=raw.get(\"max_attempts\", 5),\n        backoff_multiplier=raw.get(\"backoff_multiplier\", 2),\n    )\n"}]}}], "dialect": null, "canonical_payload": {"tool_calls": [{"name": "apply_patch", "arguments": {"edits": [{"path": "src/billing/retries.py", "content": "\"\"\"Invoice retry policy.\"\"\"\n\nimport tomllib\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom src.common.settings import config_path\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass InvoiceRetryPolicy:\n    initial_delay_seconds: int\n    max_attempts: int\n    backoff_multiplier: int\n\n\ndef load_invoice_retry_policy() -> InvoiceRetryPolicy:\n    raw: dict = {}\n    path = config_path(\"retry_policy.toml\")\n    if path.is_file():\n        with path.open(\"rb\") as file:\n            data = tomllib.load(file)\n        raw = data.get(\"invoice_retry\", {})\n\n    return InvoiceRetryPolicy(\n        initial_delay_seconds=raw.get(\"initial_delay_seconds\", 30),\n        max_attempts=raw.get(\"max_attempts\", 5),\n        backoff_multiplier=raw.get(\"backoff_multiplier\", 2),\n    )\n"}]}, "runtime_call_id": "step-5-call-1", "provider_call_id": "call_00_q9eboiUW6q98nRQxQiwY5362"}]}, "parse_error": null, "model": "deepseek-v4-pro", "provider": "openai-compatible", "response_id": "99018686-e538-47fc-b554-9f8b45e526ea", "finish_state": "tool_calls", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "actual_response_mode": "native_tools", "incomplete_reason": null, "system_fingerprint": "a307abda487cd1b463329ccb945ce396", "input_tokens": 5979, "output_tokens": 451}
